# Pre-publication audit waivers for this repository.
#
# Format:  <path-prefix>  <rule-keyword>  # <reason>
#
# The rule keyword is matched against the finding's LABEL as printed in the
# report ("Hardcoded local endpoint", "Team name", ...), not against the text
# that matched. Both fields are required: a path-only line is ignored on
# purpose, because it would waive every rule on that path, which is how a
# waiver added for one reason ends up hiding an unrelated finding.
#
# Waived hits are still printed in the report. They stop blocking; they do not
# disappear. Anything not listed here still fails the build.

